		{
			dependencies: ["62A4059C71BE0524"]
			description: [
				"唯有通过<c1>Runic Forge</c1>才能为<c2>Unique</c2>武器添加或移除<c3>Runic Tablets</c3>。"
				""
				"它还提供了一个安全的工作区，用于交换 <grad from=#B8F0FF to=#7C8CFF f=0.5>Runefused</grad> 和 <grad from=#FFB199 to=#FF3D3D f=0.5>Netherfused</grad> 宝石。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"<grad from=#EBC8FF to=#9B5CFF f=0.5>使用 FORGE 模组</grad>"
				""
				"<grad from=#EBC8FF to=#9B5CFF f=0.5>1.</grad> 将一把受支持的武器放置在<grad from=#FFF3B0 to=#FFB300 f=0.5>顶部中央的插槽中</grad>。"
				""
				"<grad from=#EBC8FF to=#9B5CFF f=0.5>2.</grad> 锻造台将其 <grad from=#D9B8FF to=#8C6CFF f=0.5>符文石板</grad> 和镶嵌宝石提取到匹配的编辑器槽位中。"
				""
				"<grad from=#EBC8FF to=#9B5CFF f=0.5>3.</grad> 将熔炉和背包中的物品移至最多<grad from=#D9B8FF to=#8C6CFF f=0.5>八个符文石板</grad>和每种宝石各一个。"
				""
				"将鼠标悬停在武器栏上，即可查看武器的<grad from=#B9F6CA to=#00C853 f=0.5>实时预览</grad>。"
				""
				"<grad from=#EBC8FF to=#9B5CFF f=0.5>5.</grad> 移除武器以<grad from=#B9F6CA to=#00C853 f=0.5>确认更改</grad>。关闭屏幕也能安全保存显示的内容。"
				""
				"<c1>八个底部槽位</c1>代表<c2>觉醒等级</c2>。侧面槽位用于放置<c3>符文融合</c3>和<c4>下界融合</c4>宝石。动画通道和高亮槽位会显示正在应用的组件。"
			]
			id: "16E24D691A9C2A99"
			rewards: [{
				id: "23483E2C487481FC"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "simplyswords:runic_tablet"
					tag: { }
				}
				random_bonus: 1
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "159D1DDFD4681996"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "simplyswords:runic_forge"
					tag: { }
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.45><neon p=9 r=1.5 a=0.08><grad from=#EBC8FF to=#9B5CFF><glitch f=1.2 j=0.008 b=0.003 s=0.05>符文锻造炉</glitch></grad></neon></shadow>"
			x: -6.5d
			y: -6.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<c1>SMELTING A UNIQUE WEAPON<c2></c1>"
				""
				"将任何不想要或重复的 <grad from=#FFF3B0 to=#FFB300 f=0.5>Unique</grad> 武器放入普通 <grad from=#E0E0E0 to=#9E9E9E f=0.5>Furnace</grad> 中进行冶炼。"
				""
				"这会<c1>摧毁武器</c1>，并产生一个<c2>赋能残骸</c2>。"
			]
			id: "62A4059C71BE0524"
			rewards: [{
				id: "1B67E3717213770F"
				item: {
					Count: 1
